# Public scanner API origin for production desk builds (no trailing slash).
# Dev (`npm run dev`) ignores this and uses the Vite `/qmie` → :8080 proxy.
# Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables → VITE_QMIE_API
# Example: https://qmie.onrender.com
# Do not set this to a *.vercel.app URL — that host is the SPA, not FastAPI.
VITE_QMIE_API=
